  <item>
    <title>EP4 简评乌军库尔斯克「外线」攻势——意图与前景</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e3fac73a5ff0a0ca333f12</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e3fac73a5ff0a0ca333f12</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 08:41:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>拖了一个多月的库尔斯克专集终于弄好了。本集录制时间为8月下旬，其中的情况和判断和现在相比已经有了一定变化。</span><br><br><span>本期主播：</span></h2><p><span>Lark</span></p><p><span>Suyi控</span><br><br><span>贡柴罗</span></p><h2><span>时间轴：</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">1:06</a> 库尔斯克行动直到8月下旬的发展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">5:38</a> 乌军的信息控制和开源信息获取</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">9:20</a> 库尔斯克目前的主要交锋在塞姆河地区</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 乌军在科列涅沃地区受到迟滞 未有实控证据</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> E38公路沿线的筑垒准备和俄军顾虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 库尔斯克地区的双方损失和统计博主</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 俄军技术装备损失的特殊性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 透明战场假说和技术进步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 乌军轮换被忽略的意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 战役背后的媒体报道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 乌军单位参战情况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 俄军单位参战情况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> 乌军战役的目的之问</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">49:54</a> 乌军的人力与伤亡问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3153">52:33</a> 乌军在顿巴斯战场上陷于被动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 库尔斯克问题的潜在政治代价</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3373">56:13</a> 库尔斯克问题的潜在政治收益</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">60:05</a> 升级管理的梦魇是否解除</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3882">64:42</a> 升级管理的内在逻辑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4033">67:13</a> 美国盟友的自行其是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4229">70:29</a> 乌克兰/以色列的异同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4356">72:36</a> 库尔斯克的发展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4400">73:20</a> 西尔斯基其实意外的不愿意承受预期外损失</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">75:30</a> 和俄国同仁将领的风格对比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4722">78:42</a> 乌军预期在库尔斯克继续作战</span></p><p><span>联系方式：yanjiuyanjiu@pm.me</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmlbMV6lc8JVBBx1MxkRyZYQn1zh.m4a" length="155497111" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:30</itunes:duration>
